                                                "sense_id": "1b978e68-0f3a-39cf-9e28-218d0fe49676",
                                                "text": "How much did that cost you? Five grand?\nSomething like that, yeah..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "206eb87a-498b-47f0-9d2c-9cc101ef4690",
                                                "sense_id": "1b978e68-0f3a-39cf-9e28-218d0fe49676",
                                                "text": "So are you two an item yet?\nEh, something like that."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a99585ae-3a6f-3286-b6a5-1d48b1c2a469",
